The extreme wakeboarding of Nikolas Plytas towed by the Luna Rossa prototype in Cagliari. Prada Linea Rossa returns to support the Greek water sports champion in a powerful adventure along Cagliari’s coast on a custom wakeboard developed for him by Luna Rossa Prada Pirelli.

