A short film goes behind the scenes with #PradaExtends – the traveling series of live events tied to music and local cultures. Creator and curator Richie Hawtin aka Plastikman takes viewers to Tokyo, a place he knows well from touring as a musician for over 25 years and from training to be an awarded Sake Sommelier. 
